    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38937" root="ملص" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُمْلَصٌ</span></b>  <i>Brought forth prematurely;</i> as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلِيصٌ</span></b> : (M, TA:) <i>an abortion.</i> (TA.) You
say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْقَتْ وَلَدَهَا مُمْلَصًا</span> <i>She cast her young one
prematurely;</i> (TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلِيصًا</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلِيطًا</span>.
(K, TA.)

